ma 7, a downstream rc.5 interoperability extension adds exact cross-language comparisons for:\n1877:  cross-language LFS fixtures (6.6.3), plus the common commit/tag byte grammar,\n1910:9. Are URL, SSH trust, tag, and structured development-ref rules exact enough for cross-language implementations?\n1962:- independent cross-language fixture checks covered the exact 1023/1024 cutoff,\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
